			"notes": "# Nova Raids v0.3.1 | Patch Update\nSorry for the long wait, after the massive last update I needed to step away from this mod for a bit. But I've come back around to it and this update now contains several patches for some of the more major bugs, along with some smaller bugs. Additionally, some small features have been added, so here's the rundown..\n\n### Key Additions:\n- All configs will now automatically update with new properties when I add things in updates\n- Added friendship related options to bosses, for moves like return :)\n- Added a weighted \"features\" section, previous features should automatically transfer to this new format\n- Added an AI skill level option to bosses, following the format of AI skill levels, 0 is random, 5 is the best it can be. Previously all raid AI was random by default (because that's how wild Pokémon are)\n- Added blacklist options to discord webhooks, so you don't need to notify people for common raids anymore :p\n- Added the option for bosses to have \"infinite\" move PP\n- Added the option for automatic battles, once a player finishes a battle, after a set delay another battle will automatically start\n- Added the option to disable raid balls being linked to player UUIDs\n- Added the `/raid schedule` command, to view all upcoming raids\n- Nova Raids will now load in singleplayer instances\n- (more in changelog)\n\n### Key Bug Fixes:\n- Bugs related to multiverse worlds should be fixed\n- Battles now stop properly, fixing item stealing with trick, and mega evolution not reverting\n- Boss clones are now invisible like they should be\n- Webhooks respect their config and now delete properly\n- If a player loses to a boss, any damage dealt will still be registered, rather than just 0\n- Fixed the `species_override` catch setting\n- Players will no longer receive a catch encounter if they leave the raid\n- Player's Pokémon will no longer receive exp from raids\n- (more in changelog)\n\nMore information about the additions and fixes are available in the [changelog](https://github.com/Unariginal/NovaRaids/blob/master/Changelog.md).\n\nThis update has been tested to the best of my ability, but be aware that there still could be bugs, especially relating to the new config updating system. So, **--> BACKUP. YOUR. CONFIGS. <--** before updating, and please post a bug report if something doesn't work properly, I will post a hotfix if anything comes up."
		}
